</div></p><p>Our <a href="https://www.ons.gov.uk/economy/governmentpublicsectorandtaxes/publicsectorfinance/datasets/publicsectorfinancesborrowingbysubsector">Public sector finances borrowing by subsector: Appendix R dataset</a> provides further detail on data presented in Table 1 and includes the option to select other time periods. </p><p>


  

