<tr><th scope="row" class="table__nowrap align-left">Central government <br/>spending on goods <br/>and services [note 4]</th><td class="align-right">38.8</td><td class="align-right">38.0</td><td class="align-right">0.8</td><td class="align-right">2.1</td></tr>
