    <h4 class="print--hide padding-top--0 margin-top--0 font-size--h6 clear-left"><span role="text">Download this chart <span class="visuallyhidden">Figure 6: Net debt as a percentage of GDP remains at levels last seen in the early 1960s</span></span></h4>

